# CR 603.6a: abilities that trigger when a permanent enters see the permanents that enter together with it. Bringer of the Last Gift
# returns every creature card in Bot1's graveyard that was not put there by its own sacrifice at once: Hinterland Sanctifier and
# Llanowar Elves, which Entomb put there on turn 1. The Sanctifier, entering with the Elves, triggers for the Elves ("another
# creature you control") and not for itself: Bot1 gains 1 life. Life: 20, less 2 from Ancient Tomb, plus 1 = 19.

